Niryo ROS2 Driver Overrides
===========================

This driver reads its default robot connection settings from:

- src/niryo_ned_ros2_driver/config/drivers_list.yaml

At runtime, you can override the defaults with environment variables so you do
not need to edit the YAML each time.

Runtime Overrides
-----------------

- ROBOT_PI or ROBOT_IP: overrides the robot IP address
- ROBOT_NAMESPACE: overrides the namespace prefix (empty string = no namespace)

If either override is set, it takes precedence over the YAML file.

Example
-------

ROBOT_PI=169.254.200.200 ROBOT_NAMESPACE=robot1 \
ros2 launch niryo_ned_ros2_driver driver.launch.py

Docker Compose example
----------------------

ROBOT_PI=169.254.200.200 ROBOT_NAMESPACE=robot1 \
docker compose -f docker-compose.lightsout.yml run --rm runtime \
  bash -lc "ros2 launch niryo_robot_simulation_client niryo_ned3pro_complete.launch.py mode:=real headless:=true"

